  "prefLabel": "He-C 1001.05 Meetings of the Commission",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 1001.05 Meetings of the Commission.\n\n(a) All meetings conducted by the commission shall be in accordance with RSA 126:83-86 and RSA 91-A.\n\n(b) Notice of the time and place of each meeting shall be posted on the commission’s internet webpage, in the department’s brown building lobby, and in the legislative office building.\n\nSource. #13396, eff 6-21-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-c1000.html"
